+---
+id: pthm-qftx-superconformal-index-beta-independence
+kind: physics-theorem
+title: Beta independence of the trace-class superconformal index
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: physics
